# Allowlist. deploy.ps1 builds the image from this folder (az acr build .), so anything
# else sitting here, such as a .env file, a downloaded token, test output or a stray
# download, must never reach the image. Only the files the server needs at run time
# are let through. A new runtime module named aces_*.py is picked up automatically.
*
!server.py
!aces_*.py
!aces_facts.json
!web_ui.html
# The chat page's fonts and their licenses.
!fonts
!fonts/*
!requirements.txt
